* The service is available in test phase at Continente Matosinhos & Continente Bom-Dia Asprela

With the new Continente Find app, you can now find your way in-store, just like you do outdoors with GPS! Currently available in Porto (and soon to all Continente locations), your shopping experience just became much more convenient. 

Features:
- Search for products and build your personal shopping list;
- Use the route built by the app to find and collect the items from your shopping list efficiently;
- Receive personalized coupons and special deals, as you navigate in-store!
